<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/modules/sector-hr.png');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Human Resources & Payroll</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Professional Workforce Orchestration.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            Manage your organization's most valuable asset with an integrated HR suite that spans 
            the entire employee lifecycle—from a job applicant's first click to their final 
            pension contribution.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            Our HR suite centralizes employee administrative tasks, financial tracking, and development 
            planning into a unified system of record.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Executive overview of headcount metrics, labor cost variance, upcoming statutory 
                    deadlines, and organizational turnover rates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/recruitment">Recruitment (ATS)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    End-to-end Applicant Tracking System (ATS) managing job requisitions, online 
                    applications, interview pipelines, and digital offer letters.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/onboarding">Employee Onboarding</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Structured transition from 'Hired' to 'Productive' with digital checklists, 
                    automated contract generation, and equipment assignment logging.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/records">Records Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive digital employee files including personal demographics, disciplinary 
                    histories, qualification archival, and dynamic organizational charts.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/leave">Leave Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Automated leave balance tracking and online approval workflows. Fully compliant 
                    with Labour Act minimum entitlements and NEC leave regulations.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/payroll">Payroll Processing</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    High-integrity salary computation for USD/ZiG. Native generation of payslips, 
                    bank upload files, and ZIMRA/NSSA/ZIMDEF statutory returns.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/performance">Performance Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    KPI and Balanced Scorecard integration. Manage annual review cycles, 
                    360-degree feedback, and performance improvement plans (PIP).
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/training">Training & Development</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Manage the organizational training calendar, track certification expiration, 
                    and analyze Training ROI and professional development progress.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hr/analytics">HR Analytics</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Deep dive into gender diversity, tenure analytics, recruitment efficiency, 
                    and leave liability valuations for financial reporting.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digital Recruitment & Talent Acquisition</h2>
        <p>
            Find and secure the best talent with an integrated Applicant Tracking System (ATS). 
            Our recruitment module automates the publishing of job advertisements to 
            internal portals and external boards, providing a structured pipeline for 
            managing candidates through screening, interviewing, and offer development. 
            Once a candidate is hired, their data flows instantly into the employee 
            record and payroll systems, eliminating redundant manual data entry.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated psychometric testing and survey capabilities (inspired by IPC Consultants' 
            benchmark tools) provide HR teams with objective data to support hiring 
            decisions and ensure organizational culture fit.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Statutory-First Payroll Computing</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate the risks of payroll non-compliance with a core engine engineered for the 
            Zimbabwean tax and social security framework. The system precisely calculates 
            progressive PAYE, handles NSSA contribution ceilings, and generates 
            authoritative returns for ZIMDEF and the AIDS Levy. Our multi-currency 
            architecture allows for seamless management of USD allowances and ZiG 
            net-pay conversions within a single run.
        </p>
        <p>
            Bank upload files are generated in standard formats (CBZ, Stanbic, FBC), 
            ensuring that salary disbursements are rapid and free from clerical 
            errors, while employees receive encrypted digital payslips directly 
            to their devices.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Structural Performance & Growth</h2>
        <p>
            Move performance management from a once-a-year administrative task to a strategic growth 
            driver. Align individual KPIs directly to organization-level Balanced Scorecard 
            objectives, ensuring every employee understands their contribution to the 
            company's success. 360-degree feedback loops and structured performance 
            improvement plans provide a transparent environment for professional 
            stewardship.
        </p>
        <p>
            Training needs analysis is automatically derived from performance reviews, 
            populating the training module to ensure that skills development is 
            targeted where it will have the most significant organizational impact.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Resilient Records & Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain absolute organizational order with comprehensive digital personnel files. Every 
            contractual change, disciplinary event, and certification achievement is 
            permanently recorded in a search-optimized document library. Our dynamic 
            organizational chart updates in real-time as reporting lines change, 
            providing clarity on departmental structures and supporting succession 
            planning for high-potential employees.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

